{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d698b3d6-87ac-4be4-9776-15b4093e957c",
    "name": "GovtPrep — Forgot & Reset Password",
    "description": "Covers POST /api/auth/forgot-password and POST /api/auth/reset-password end to end: validation errors, the anti-enumeration behavior (same generic response for registered and unregistered emails), the happy path, and confirming a used/expired token can't be replayed.\n\nNo pre-request or test scripts are included — every response shown is exactly what the backend returns.\n\nHow to run:\n1. (Optional but recommended) Override the collection variable `testEmail` with a real inbox you control — forgotPassword sends a real email via Gmail SMTP (see utils/emailService.js), and the raw reset token only ever exists in that email/URL, never in an API response or log.\n2. Run \"0. Setup > Register Test User\" once to create the test user.\n3. Run \"1. Forgot Password\" top to bottom.\n4. Open the email sent to `testEmail`, copy the `token` query-param value from the reset link, and set it as the collection variable `resetToken`.\n5. Run \"2. Reset Password - Validation\" (no email needed, these all fail before touching the real token).\n6. Run \"3. Reset Password - Happy Path\" top to bottom.\n7. Run \"4. Verify\" to confirm the new password works and the old one no longer does.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "35140089"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Test User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Postman Test User\",\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"mobile\": \"{{testMobile}}\",\n  \"username\": \"{{testUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{originalPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Creates a fresh test user with a known email/password so the rest of the collection has predictable data to work with. Set testEmail/testUsername/testMobile as collection variables before running (or edit the body directly), since there is no pre-request script to auto-generate them here."
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Forgot Password",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Missing Email - 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "forgot-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Registered Email - 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "forgot-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Unregistered Email - 200 (anti-enumeration check)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"definitely-not-registered-{{$timestamp}}@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "forgot-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Both the registered and unregistered case return the same 200 and the same generic message: \"If an account with that email exists, a password reset link has been sent.\""
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Reset Password - Validation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Missing Fields - 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Weak Password (<6 chars) - 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"placeholder-token\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid/Garbage Token - 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"clearly-not-a-real-token-1234567890\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{newPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "These all fail on input validation before ever touching the database, so they don't require a real token."
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Reset Password - Happy Path (manual token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Valid Token - 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{newPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Reused Token - 400 (can't be replayed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{newPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Requires the collection variable `resetToken` to be set from a real reset email (see the collection description for the full flow). These two requests can't run correctly during an automated/CI run without that manual step."
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Verify",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login With New Password - 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{newPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login With Old Password - 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{originalPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000"
    },
    {
      "key": "testEmail",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "testUsername",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "testMobile",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "originalPassword",
      "value": "OldPass123"
    },
    {
      "key": "newPassword",
      "value": "NewPass456"
    },
    {
      "key": "resetToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}
